{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-487\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>關禮傑愛女關楓馨（Fabi）近日趁著好天氣出海遊玩，更在社交平台上大派福利，分享了一系列在遊艇上拍攝的唯美日落靚相。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"558dc886-a1fe-4618-9b00-7cbb49ec81bd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/20268gKY0EOrZk1791281952.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"558dc886-a1fe-4618-9b00-7cbb49ec81bd.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-487\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-487\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-488\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從相片中可見，她身穿一件低胸吊帶小背心，配搭同色系波點短褲，打扮充滿濃厚的夏日氣息。她同時大方展露了迷人的鎖骨與纖幼的小蠻腰，散發出健康又帶點微性感的光芒。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-488\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-488\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7fe534f1-234f-401f-8977-ea15e041b576.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026G7FKvTnElr1791281952.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7fe534f1-234f-401f-8977-ea15e041b576.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-488\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_b9339aba827d4986-489\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>在夕陽光線的映照下，Fabi 擺出多個不同的甫士，對著鏡頭展露甜美笑容。其中一張側面照更精準捕捉了她舉起雙手綁頭髮的瞬間，完美展現出優美的背部線條與精緻的側臉輪廓，養眼十足。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T11:00:17.148313+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}